#### Phase 4: Centralized Observability (Weeks 10-11)

**4.1 Deploy Prometheus Federation**

```yaml
# prometheus-federation.yaml
global:
  scrape_interval: 30s
  evaluation_interval: 30s

scrape_configs:

- job_name: 'federate-clusters'
  honor_labels: true
  metrics_path: '/federate'
  params:
    'match[]':
      - '{job=~".+"}'

  static_configs:

  - targets:
    - prometheus.medicaid-prod-us-east-1:9090
    - prometheus.payment-integrity-prod-us-east-1:9090
    - prometheus.pharmacy-prod-us-east-1:9090
    labels:
      cluster: 'federated'
```

**4.2 Grafana Dashboards**

```json
{
  "dashboard": {
    "title": "Multi-Cluster Overview",
    "panels": [
      {
        "title": "Cluster Health Status",
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "up{job='kubernetes-apiservers'}",
            "legendFormat": "{{cluster}}"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Total Pod Count by Cluster",
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(kube_pod_info) by (cluster)",
            "legendFormat": "{{cluster}}"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Node Resource Utilization",
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(node_memory_MemTotal_bytes - node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes) by (cluster) / sum(node_memory_MemTotal_bytes) by (cluster) * 100",
            "legendFormat": "{{cluster}} Memory"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
```
